      "file": "docs/CHANGELOG-archive.md",
      "line": 173,
      "text": "- **Responsive workflow context surface.** Added the Plan-first ambient context ribbon, responsive desktop deck, mobile segmented safe-area sheet, optional Phase/Task capture, direct notes/sessions/execution links, manual timestamp/**Now** controls, observed terminal suggestions, focus-safe shortcut ownership, and loading/error/empty states."
